  follow_up_message = $$Hi Stan, following up in case my earlier note got buried. I outlined the commercial growth approach behind RevHub here: https://aboutchad.com/approach. Based on your role at Flosum, I believe there may be a relevant opportunity around stan is building flosum's revops foundation and is close to challenges around funnel definitions, source data, forecasting, gtm infrastructure, and executive reporting. because he is below the seniority of the fractional marketing leader mandate, outreach should focus on the problems he is solving rather than the open role. Would you be open to a quick 15-minute call to discuss the approach and whether it could be useful to your team?$$
