ions connect customer and market intelligence, segmentation, pricing, marketing, sales execution, operations, forecasting and executive reporting into one commercial growth system. For Wpromote, the opportunity I see is: RevHub can help Andrew accelerate the operating architecture behind the internal hires by defining shared lifecycle stages, source and campaign standards, revenue-system governance, forecast inputs, executive metrics, and the decision rules connecting marketing activity to pipeline and closed revenue. Would you be open to a quick 15-minute call to discuss what we do and whether it could support your priorities?$$, $$Hi Andrew, following up in case my earlier note got buried. I outlined the commercial growth approach behind RevHub here: https://aboutchad.com/approach. Based on your role at Wpromote, I believe there may be a relevant opportunity around wpromote is simultaneously hiring senior leaders across revenue operations, revenue systems, and b2b data strategy and revenue analytics. the roles connect campaign tracking, marketing automation, crm, seller context, pipeline, forecasting, governance, and trusted executive reporting. andrew leads wpromote's revenue organization and has publicly promoted the buildout of its revops engine. Would you be open to a quick 15-minute call to discuss the approach and whether it could be useful to your team?$$, null, null, null, null, null);

