 marketing, sales execution, operations, forecasting and executive reporting into one commercial growth system. For Metro Vein Centers, the opportunity I see is: Chad and Harsh can help Ada connect patient segmentation, acquisition, intake, booking, attendance, treatment completion, reactivation, HubSpot governance, channel economics, and executive reporting into one measurable lifecycle growth system. Would you be open to a quick 15-minute call to discuss what we do and whether it could support your priorities?$$, $$Hi Ada, following up in case my earlier note got buried. I outlined the commercial growth approach behind RevHub here: https://aboutchad.com/approach. Based on your role at Metro Vein Centers, I believe there may be a relevant opportunity around metro vein centers is hiring a director of lifecycle marketing to own the patient journey from inquiry through booking, attendance, treatment completion, and reactivation. ada leads marketing and patient experience and has publicly promoted the company's marketing hiring, making her the senior functional owner above the director-level role. Would you be open to a quick 15-minute call to discuss the approach and whether it could be useful to your team?$$, null, null, null, null, null);

